# Line-ending policy (see backend/docker-entrypoint.sh cold-start incident).
#
# Shell entrypoints must always be LF. On Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true, a CRLF docker-entrypoint.sh ships into the container where
# dash reads `set -e\r` and aborts with "set: Illegal option -", sending the
# backend into a crash loop. Pin LF for .sh regardless of local git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
